WEBVTT

00:13:26.491 --> 00:13:30.188
por doktori juaj mund te mos e dije pergjigjen, akoma.

00:13:30.188 --> 00:13:34.564
Por nese ti ben pyetjen,

00:13:34.564 --> 00:13:36.846
doktori do kerkoje per pergjigjen.

00:13:36.846 --> 00:13:39.183
Dhe kjo eshte kaq e rendesishme,

00:13:39.183 --> 00:13:41.345
jo vetem per ne,

00:13:41.345 --> 00:13:43.998
por per te gjithe ata qe duam.

00:13:43.998 --> 00:13:48.482
Qofte nene, vajze, moter,

00:13:48.482 --> 00:13:52.179
shoqe apo gjyshe.

00:13:52.179 --> 00:13:54.322
Ishte vuajtja e gjyshes time

00:13:54.322 --> 00:13:56.255
qe me frymezoi

00:13:56.255 --> 00:13:59.240
per te permiresuar shendetin e gruas.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.590
Kjo eshte legacia e saj.